"# Pulling into work\nIt’s dead\nThere are 4 other cars here at 7:30\n\nClassical radio was playing jazz\nAnd I recognized the tune kinda\nAnd I realized\nWait\nIs this “just a gigolo” which has been in my head for a week now?\nAnd I figured maybe this and that are based on the Frodoe tune (which I’ve been able to match to all other music played on the car ride, so...)\n\nBut no\nIt was literally “just a gigolo”\n1960-something. I’ll see if I can find it.\n(Update: no luck. Found a Django Reinhardt version though.)\n\nOk six other cars now.\n![](dayone-moment://F108657E96F5492CA4E6BDFF0713C743)\n* * *\nSwapping Lego hairs with Katrina\nFor my Lego Emma Frost\n![](dayone-moment://3EC17BE1460F4F82B073FF63FE662455)\n![](dayone-moment://0A442BCB5328473FBE705BDC369CCB70)\n![](dayone-moment://D34FAC2C8C0B478EA22ADE37EFBB774F)\n![](dayone-moment://804375F637044FA78235E536A2DB28EA)\n\nHonestly?\nI think this looks more like her anyway.\n* * *\nLooks like were good for now on allocations - Carpenter and I had ours ending in June\nBut I just checked with Dimestore and the latest is to keep going with existing allocations)\n"